{"type":"app","meta":{"headers":{"x-nextjs-stale-time":"300","x-nextjs-prerender":"1","x-next-cache-tags":"_N_T_/layout,_N_T_/page,_N_T_/,_N_T_/index"},"segmentPaths":["/_tree","/_full","/__PAGE__","/_index","/_head"]},"html":"<!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\"en\"><head><meta charSet=\"utf-8\"/><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"/><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/_next/static/chunks/0sfau0z-x0nq6.css\" data-precedence=\"next\"/><link rel=\"preload\" as=\"script\" fetchPriority=\"low\" href=\"/_next/static/chunks/15h18laaocxip.js\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/35amsvaiyfw1u.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/2-xoq54es8u-n.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/3tm2z4a_k_v01.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/turbopack-0gg9vs036n-_s.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/2xq8boewyqnba.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/155lmae68jiq6.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/2qer4q0s1364u.js\" async=\"\"></script><title>Speed Run Games</title><meta name=\"description\" content=\"Browser games you run against the clock. Post your time, climb the board.\"/><link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.svg?icon.3s4o0a54evktl.svg\" sizes=\"any\" type=\"image/svg+xml\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/0cz1d0mv5g_q7.js\" noModule=\"\"></script></head><body><div hidden=\"\"><!--$--><!--/$--></div><header><div class=\"header-inner\"><a class=\"site-logo\" href=\"/\"><span class=\"logo-mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\">⏱</span><span class=\"logo-name\">Speed Run Games</span></a><nav class=\"site-nav\" aria-label=\"Primary\"><a href=\"/#games\">Games</a><a href=\"/#records\">Records</a><details class=\"games-menu\"><summary aria-label=\"Browse all games\">All games<span class=\"chev\" aria-hidden=\"true\">▾</span></summary><div class=\"games-menu-panel\"><a href=\"/games/green-circle-td/\"><span class=\"menu-emoji\" aria-hidden=\"true\">🟢</span>Green Circle TD</a><a href=\"/games/line-tower-wars/\"><span class=\"menu-emoji\" aria-hidden=\"true\">🏰</span>Line Tower Wars</a><a href=\"/games/pokemonspeedrungen1/\"><span class=\"menu-emoji\" aria-hidden=\"true\">🎙️</span>Pokémon Speedrun Gen 1</a><a href=\"/games/shard-dominion/\"><span class=\"menu-emoji\" aria-hidden=\"true\">🎮</span>Shard Dominion</a><a href=\"/games/shard-dominion-v2/\"><span class=\"menu-emoji\" aria-hidden=\"true\">🎮</span>Shard Dominion v2</a><a href=\"/games/shard-dominion-chat/\"><span class=\"menu-emoji\" aria-hidden=\"true\">🎮</span>Shard Dominion: Chat Version</a><a href=\"/games/shard-dominion-fable/\"><span class=\"menu-emoji\" aria-hidden=\"true\">⚔️</span>Shard Dominion: Fable</a><a href=\"/games/tank-you-again/\"><span class=\"menu-emoji\" aria-hidden=\"true\">🕹️</span>Tank You Again</a><a href=\"/games/tower-wars/\"><span class=\"menu-emoji\" aria-hidden=\"true\">🛡️</span>Tower Wars</a><a href=\"/games/tower-wars-2/\"><span class=\"menu-emoji\" aria-hidden=\"true\">🏰</span>Tower Wars II</a></div></details></nav></div></header><main><div class=\"home\"><div class=\"home-head\"><div><h1>Browser games, run against the clock</h1><p class=\"tagline\">Pick a game, post your time, climb the board. Tower defense, tank arenas, and a voice-controlled Pokemon dash.</p></div><span class=\"run-count\"><span class=\"dot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"num\">10</span>games live</span></div><div class=\"games-grid\" id=\"games\"><a href=\"/games/green-circle-td/\" class=\"game-tile is-featured\"><span class=\"game-emoji\" aria-hidden=\"true\">🟢</span><h3 class=\"game-title\">Green Circle TD</h3><p class=\"game-desc\">Maze tower defense: creeps circle in from four corners to the center, passing every position. TRUE ONLINE MULTIPLAYER (2–4 players): WC3-style lobby with 4-letter room codes, authoritative server, per-player build zones, shared lives. Plus procedural turret + creep graphics, Lv1-3 upgrades and 2-way specializations, armor-vs-damage matrix including WC3 chaos damage, air-targeting restriction, randomized wave order, distinct creep archetypes, local hot-seat co-op, aura towers, Mint economy tower, interest economy, stackable waves, 1×/2×/3× speed, and 30 escalating waves to a multi-phase boss.</p><span class=\"game-meta\"><span class=\"live-badge\"><span class=\"live-dot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>Playable</span><span class=\"game-go\">Play<span class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span></span></span></a><a href=\"/games/line-tower-wars/\" class=\"game-tile\"><span class=\"game-emoji\" aria-hidden=\"true\">🏰</span><h3 class=\"game-title\">Line Tower Wars</h3><p class=\"game-desc\">Standalone web Line Tower Wars, inspired by the Warcraft 3 custom map — build a maze, leak creeps to your opponent.</p><span class=\"game-meta\"><span class=\"live-badge\"><span class=\"live-dot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>Playable</span><span class=\"game-go\">Play<span class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span></span></span></a><a href=\"/games/pokemonspeedrungen1/\" class=\"game-tile\"><span class=\"game-emoji\" aria-hidden=\"true\">🎙️</span><h3 class=\"game-title\">Pokémon Speedrun Gen 1</h3><p class=\"game-desc\">Voice-first (tap fallback) Gen 1 Pokémon speedrun. Name all 151 as fast as you can.</p><span class=\"game-meta\"><span class=\"live-badge\"><span class=\"live-dot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>Playable</span><span class=\"game-go\">Play<span class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span></span></span></a><a href=\"/games/shard-dominion/\" class=\"game-tile\"><span class=\"game-emoji\" aria-hidden=\"true\">🎮</span><h3 class=\"game-title\">Shard Dominion</h3><p class=\"game-desc\">Classic sci-fi RTS: asymmetric factions, harvester economy, concrete-and-power base building on Aether Prime</p><span class=\"game-meta\"><span class=\"live-badge\"><span class=\"live-dot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>Playable</span><span class=\"game-go\">Play<span class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span></span></span></a><a href=\"/games/shard-dominion-v2/\" class=\"game-tile\"><span class=\"game-emoji\" aria-hidden=\"true\">🎮</span><h3 class=\"game-title\">Shard Dominion v2</h3><p class=\"game-desc\">Classic sci-fi RTS on Aether Prime — bake-off build 3, from the Hermes Execution Manifest v2.0 (veterancy, hazard zones)</p><span class=\"game-meta\"><span class=\"live-badge\"><span class=\"live-dot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>Playable</span><span class=\"game-go\">Play<span class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span></span></span></a><a href=\"/games/shard-dominion-chat/\" class=\"game-tile\"><span class=\"game-emoji\" aria-hidden=\"true\">🎮</span><h3 class=\"game-title\">Shard Dominion: Chat Version</h3><p class=\"game-desc\">Classic sci-fi RTS on Aether Prime — bake-off build 2, from the chat-version build package</p><span class=\"game-meta\"><span class=\"live-badge\"><span class=\"live-dot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>Playable</span><span class=\"game-go\">Play<span class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span></span></span></a><a href=\"/games/shard-dominion-fable/\" class=\"game-tile\"><span class=\"game-emoji\" aria-hidden=\"true\">⚔️</span><h3 class=\"game-title\">Shard Dominion: Fable</h3><p class=\"game-desc\">A real-time strategy game where you harvest Aether Shards and expand your dominion across a procedurally generated world.</p><span class=\"game-meta\"><span class=\"live-badge\"><span class=\"live-dot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>Playable</span><span class=\"game-go\">Play<span class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span></span></span></a><a href=\"/games/tank-you-again/\" class=\"game-tile\"><span class=\"game-emoji\" aria-hidden=\"true\">🕹️</span><h3 class=\"game-title\">Tank You Again</h3><p class=\"game-desc\">Real-time multiplayer tank arena. 8-way movement, fuel-as-health, landmines, masked radar, 10-tier rank ladder.</p><span class=\"game-meta\"><span class=\"live-badge\"><span class=\"live-dot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>Playable</span><span class=\"game-go\">Play<span class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span></span></span></a><a href=\"/games/tower-wars/\" class=\"game-tile\"><span class=\"game-emoji\" aria-hidden=\"true\">🛡️</span><h3 class=\"game-title\">Tower Wars</h3><p class=\"game-desc\">Maze tower defense with income/sends, hero towers, and large-map pan/zoom control.</p><span class=\"game-meta\"><span class=\"live-badge\"><span class=\"live-dot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>Playable</span><span class=\"game-go\">Play<span class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span></span></span></a><a href=\"/games/tower-wars-2/\" class=\"game-tile\"><span class=\"game-emoji\" aria-hidden=\"true\">🏰</span><h3 class=\"game-title\">Tower Wars II</h3><p class=\"game-desc\">Branching tower upgrades, balanced enemy waves, and a fresh take on maze TD.</p><span class=\"game-meta\"><span class=\"live-badge\"><span class=\"live-dot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span>Playable</span><span class=\"game-go\">Play<span class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span></span></span></a></div><section class=\"records\" id=\"records\" aria-label=\"Recent runs\"><div class=\"records-head\"><h2>Recent runs</h2><span class=\"records-sub\">Newest first, time in mm:ss.ms</span></div><ul class=\"records-list\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><li class=\"record-skeleton\"><span class=\"skel skel-rank\"></span><span><span class=\"skel skel-line-1\"></span><span class=\"skel skel-line-2\"></span></span><span class=\"skel skel-time\"></span></li><li class=\"record-skeleton\"><span class=\"skel skel-rank\"></span><span><span class=\"skel skel-line-1\"></span><span class=\"skel skel-line-2\"></span></span><span class=\"skel skel-time\"></span></li><li class=\"record-skeleton\"><span class=\"skel skel-rank\"></span><span><span class=\"skel skel-line-1\"></span><span class=\"skel skel-line-2\"></span></span><span class=\"skel skel-time\"></span></li><li class=\"record-skeleton\"><span class=\"skel skel-rank\"></span><spa